n                  <span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700;\">SPXC</span>\n                  <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; padding: 2px 8px; background-color: #d1fae5; color: #059669; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;\">LIKELY CLOSED</span>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;\">The defense-rule exit decided 2026-08-25 appears to have executed sometime between then and Sept 29 — live IBKR data from that date shows no SPXC position. Cash math ($432.16 vs. $330.60, a $101.56 gain) points to the $205.00 GTC exit-limit filling rather than the $186.90 stop: 0.5 sh × $205 − ~$1 commission ≈ $101.50, a near-exact match. That would be a small net gain (~+$0.60 on $100.96 cost basis) rather than the loss a stop-fill would have produced. <strong>Not confirmed</strong> — get the IBKR fill record and log it via portfolio-manager.</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- MOVERS -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 20px 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">📈 Top Gainers — Sept 30, 2026</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 8px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">+%</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">What happened</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Type</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Contagion</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">CNTB</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color: #059669;\">+124%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Positive Phase 2 COPD trial data</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Trial readout</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">None</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">IOVA</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color: #059669;\">+30%+</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Raised FY26 revenue guidance to $410-420M, above consensus</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Guidance raise</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">None</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 11px; color: #9ca3af;\">A reliable third gainer couldn't be verified today (search surfaced mostly thinly-traded OTC noise) — excluded per the \"default to excluding\" rule rather than reporting unverifiable data.</p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">📉 Top Losers — Sept 30, 2026</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-